  "body": "### Summary\n\n`DuoLayoutHostedTests/aFoldShowsTheTopicOpenInTheTab(tab: .messages)` (added by #1115, LOT-147) fails locally on an iPhone 18 Pro simulator, on `dev-swift` and on #1123's branch alike, while `dev-swift` CI is green at 8e64daa7. Find why, so the test is reliable (or proves what it claims) on every run.\n\n### Facts (mac/M1, 2026-11-18, iPhone 18 Pro simulator iOS 27.0, whole `SwiftHFRTests` target, parallel testing off)\n\n- Only the `.messages` case fails; `.categories` passes.\n- It fails **before the fold**, at `DuoLayoutTests.swift:294` (`await settle(window) { split(in: window) != nil && shows(title, in: window) }`), then `:298` (`folded`) as a consequence; 60.8 s (the settle timeout).\n- Fable's round-2 review of #1115 already noted that in the mutation run the Messages case went red at `:294` before the fold (`rootSwapped` firing when the host's first size classes arrive).\n- #1115's own whole-target runs were on the iPhone Duo simulator; CI runs on an iPhone 18 Pro and was green.\n\n### Scope\n\n- Reproduce on the iPhone 18 Pro simulator (the suite alone, then in the whole target), compare with CI's log of 8e64daa7.\n- Name the cause (`file:line`): test setup (size classes the host starts with on a non-Duo iPhone, order with #1117's list look) or app code (`RootModel.rootSwapped`, `MessagesRootView`).\n- Fix the test or the code; the suite green 10× on iPhone 18 Pro and on the Duo.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Cause named with evidence; the case green 10× in a row on iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone Duo simulators, and in CI.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
