   "body": "Done in #1127 (merged as b2b6628641b81904ef6bfcc3d44b8fd5d83b6b0b). Cause: the hosted Messages list was built logged out, so its load answered `.signedOut` and closed the open conversation, racing the reader's title (test setup, not the app: a logged-out list must close it, LOT-126, legacy `clearTopicSelections()` @ 87fe0d1c). Red 8/10 alone and 10/10 under load before; green 20/20 + 20/20 under load + 10/10 on the Duo after; the test now also catches a conversation lost on the reload after a fold.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
